  "copy": {
    "fr": {
      "tagline": "Un Bubble Shooter magique où il faut aller plus vite que le mal qui ronge les bulles. Sois rapide et plus malin que la contamination.",
      "tags": [
        "Vise rapidement",
        "Grappe de trois",
        "Contamination"
      ]
    },
    "en": {
      "tagline": "A magic bubble shooter where you must outpace the evil gnawing at the bubbles. Be quick, and outsmart the blight.",
      "tags": [
        "Aim fast",
        "Cluster of three",
        "Race the rot"
      ]
    }
  },
  "description": "Drag to aim, release to fire and match 3 bubbles to pop them — a cluster goes off one bubble at a time, each scoring on its own. Swap the loaded bubble for the next one whenever you like. Rainbows are jokers: one in the wall takes the colour of whatever lands on it, one fired into the rot gives a pocket of blighted bubbles their colour back — and those bubbles stay on the board. There is no clock: the blight winds up until the whole wall has turned, so the round is a race against it, and a cut-off bubble bursting on the floor pays a bonus on the way out.",
